>
  <header class="article-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE / SHARE / 2019</p>
    <h1>深度探索二维码及其应用</h1>
    <p class="article-meta"><span>2019.01.15</span><span>Historical archive</span><span>Original text preserved</span></p>
