  <article class="article-shell">
    <a class="article-back" href="/notes/"><Icon name="arrow" size={17} /> Back to all notes</a>
    <aside class="archive-notice" aria-label="Archive notice">
      <Icon name="spark" size={22} />
      <div>
        <strong>历史归档 · 原文保留</strong>
        <p>本文写于 2019 年，外部资料、代码与工具状态可能已经变化。正文未作事实修订。</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="prose">
